CHAPTER.VERS:
Let all them be put to shame that serve graven images, That boast themselves of idols: Worship him, all you

          {+}
         gods.

O you

          {+}
         who love Yahweh, hate evil: He preserves the souls of his saints; He delivers them out of the hand of the wicked.

Be glad in Yahweh, you

          {+}
         righteous; And give thanks to his holy memorial [name].
